**Handoff** The native replay on source `d46f719a7d8d` plus the recorded changes ended 0.277 canvas units from the Area target. The other Sand fell from 80 to 10.000. Both slept. A second process reopened both placements and the untouched Sand in workspace 2. In three real-clock runs, 192 held-drag input observations gave a p95 of 56.50 ms to changed presentation state. The fixture and first-consumer checks passed for 01.W02 and 01.W03. Stage 002 can start. [November replay, findings and reproduction steps](../../../fixtures/workspace/stage01/resumption-2026-11-22/README.md)

**Laboratory showcase.** In **showoff workspace**, move a Physics Sand into the circular Area and raise and release the Gravity Sand. The cumulative replay observes attraction and falling during a model edit, switches to Home and back, and checks the saved workspace again. The isolated baseline above retains the settling, idle and timing checks. [Showcase guide and cumulative replay](../../../fixtures/workspace/showcase/README.md)

